{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAGDORE</strong> is a single-player physics sandbox where damage isn't just decoration\u2014it's the whole point...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/97f12edf002e919718a826df57d719de.poster.avif?t=1767906062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/97f12edf002e919718a826df57d719de.webm?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/97f12edf002e919718a826df57d719de.mp4?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83e\uddb4 Tear apart a fully simulated character: break bones, rip off limbs, get crushed, stabbed, or blown up\u2014while movement dynamically adjusts to what's left of your body. Stumble with broken legs, crawl with no arms, or crawl across the floor with whatever's left of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 RAGDORE offers 3 sandbox maps at launch:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll Park</strong> \u2013 a colorful playground of giant slides and ramps designed for chaotic ragdoll tumbling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Mountain</strong> \u2013 a high-altitude fall map for pure ragdoll carnage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygon Map\u00a0</strong>\u2013 a dense industrial testing facility packed with interactive hazards: crushers, shredders, spike traps, trampolines, explosive barrels, saws, and more.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.poster.avif?t=1767906062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.webm?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.mp4?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae There's <strong>no set goal</strong> \u2013 just raw experimentation and chaotic fun with physics-based destruction.\u00a0No plot. No goal. Just chaos\ud83d\ude4c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully simulated character damage &amp; movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully placed map hazards like crushers, saws, and trampolines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dummy NPC for testing and creative abuse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with realistic physical reactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/7ba7e684fc8811ca50a5892d5f03de12.poster.avif?t=1767906062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/7ba7e684fc8811ca50a5892d5f03de12.webm?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/7ba7e684fc8811ca50a5892d5f03de12.mp4?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're launching your character into a shredder or crawling away without limbs, <strong>RAGDORE</strong> turns pain into pure entertainment.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"OG Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/849ad93964c01f58a52472f2a8b5eba2ef416082.jpg"},{"name":"Small red barrel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/9370d2b6db545320f4d2704d9f3d62275bd42810.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/cb6db72e5dfe020fcb67202450a15d81e96d9a28.jpg"},{"name":"Got hit by a plane","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/84073a8de451b700862b51c2faf0d9bac16633a3.jpg"},{"name":"Die 10 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/4afab10154baf6d546f358da31aa0a0aef006468.jpg"},{"name":"Die 100 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/f67990d2d340735250b0d9ef24d1202b6f02e202.jpg"},{"name":"Find a peace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/f8f85ea5b30e5514d19f1a371a52b7071fe6376c.jpg"},{"name":"Break Bone 10 Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/856450dae7fa31cea39f95d48980cc79b9cd5808.jpg"},{"name":"Break Bone 100 Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/26cc57867cc4bcf6485e5f927b3e3e951d692ddf.jpg"},{"name":"Break Bone 1000 Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860100/106d21f8acc5a21433a10f07d80a232b15143f39.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860100?t=1767906062","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860100?t=1767906062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/dc362bbecdffc0791558276523e72efd9ddf1139/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767906062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/dc3