<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygon Map\u00a0</strong>\u2013 a dense industrial testing facility packed with interactive hazards: crushers, shredders, spike traps, trampolines, explosive barrels, saws, and more.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.poster.avif?t=1767906062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.webm?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/9f64dab655ce5128bb12a0f705d71059.mp4?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae There's <strong>no set goal</strong> \u2013 just raw experimentation and chaotic fun with physics-based destruction.\u00a0No plot. No goal. Just chaos\ud83d\ude4c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully simulated character damage &amp; movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully placed map hazards like crushers, saws, and trampolines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dummy NPC for testing and creative abuse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with realistic physical reactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/7ba7e684fc8811ca50a5892d5f03de12.poster.avif?t=1767906062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860100/extras/7ba7e684fc8811ca50a5892d5f03de12.webm?t=1767906062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour